endobj
1095 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 484 0 R
/T (1. Coverage Blindspots: Uninstrumented tools or direct API calls that bypass the gateway may remain invisible. Complete coverage requires consistent instrumentation, controlled ingress routing and coverage accounting.)
/E (1. Coverage Blindspots: Uninstrumented tools or direct API calls that bypass the gateway may remain invisible. Complete coverage requires consistent instrumentation, controlled ingress routing and coverage accounting.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1096 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 484 0 R
/T (2. No Intent Inference: The framework records what transpired, not neural decision rationale. Attribution does not determine whether an action was intended, flawed, or prompt-injected.)
/E (2. No Intent Inference: The framework records what transpired, not neural decision rationale. Attribution does not determine whether an action was intended, flawed, or prompt-injected.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
1097 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 484 0 R
/T (3. Semantic Loss: Summarizing or sanitizing inter-agent messages can remove contextual details needed for detailed forensic analysis. Full-content capture improves visibility but increases privacy and storage risks.)
/E (3. Semantic Loss: Summarizing or sanitizing inter-agent messages can remove contextual details needed for detailed forensic analysis. Full-content capture improves visibility but increases privacy and storage risks.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
1098 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 484 0 R
/T (5. Observability Only: Purely a monitoring and forensic substrate; does not block, preemptively alert, or roll back unauthorized actions at runtime.)
/E (5. Observability Only: Purely a monitoring and forensic substrate; does not block, preemptively alert, or roll back unauthorized actions at runtime.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1099 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 484 0 R
/T (4. System Overhead: The reference CIM evaluation reports +0.01 ms median latency, +0.29 ms p95 latency and +247 bytes/event overhead. These measurements require validation at larger scale and for the proposed interaction extension.)
/E (4. System Overhead: The reference CIM evaluation reports +0.01 ms median latency, +0.29 ms p95 latency and +247 bytes/event overhead. These measurements require validation at larger scale and for the proposed interaction extension.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
1100 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 484 0 R
/T (6. Telemetry Security: Audit trails require tamper-evident / integrity-protected storage and cryptographic minting at the gateway to prevent malicious delegation_id forgery.)
/E (6. Telemetry Security: Audit trails require tamper-evident / integrity-protected storage and cryptographic minting at the gateway to prevent malicious delegation_id forgery.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [6]
>>
